Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.24,0:00:03.28,ZH,HARALD,0,0,0,,它夜里开花。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.24,0:00:03.28,SV,HARALD,0,0,0,,Den blommar på natten.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.98,0:00:07.30,ZH,METTE,0,0,0,,我没看见花。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.98,0:00:07.30,SV,METTE,0,0,0,,Jag ser inga blommor.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.18,0:00:09.54,ZH,HARALD,0,0,0,,要等十年。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.18,0:00:09.54,SV,HARALD,0,0,0,,Det tar 10 år.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.16,0:00:13.44,ZH,HARALD,0,0,0,,它只在一个夜晚开花，然后就死了。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.16,0:00:13.44,SV,HARALD,0,0,0,,Blommar den ena natten så dör den.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.28,0:00:17.08,ZH,METTE,0,0,0,,他已经出发了，
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.28,0:00:17.08,SV,METTE,0,0,0,,Han har åkat.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.08,0:00:17.80,ZH,METTE,0,0,0,,还等了那么久。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.08,0:00:17.80,SV,METTE,0,0,0,,Och väntat så länge.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.52,0:00:23.04,ZH,HARALD,0,0,0,,这事得花时间。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.52,0:00:23.04,SV,HARALD,0,0,0,,Man får ta tid.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.82,0:00:28.24,ZH,METTE,0,0,0,,可他真的没有等十年。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.82,0:00:28.24,SV,METTE,0,0,0,,Men han har verkligen inte väntat i tio\Når.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.36,0:00:33.10,ZH,HARALD,0,0,0,,二十四……差不多是最早种下的不同植物\N。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.36,0:00:33.10,SV,HARALD,0,0,0,,24 nästan först med olika planter.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.96,0:00:36.64,ZH,METTE,0,0,0,,太厉害了！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.96,0:00:36.64,SV,METTE,0,0,0,,Superkarkar!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.06,0:00:41.34,ZH,METTE,0,0,0,,我一直在想那些植物。我等了一辈子，然\N后……
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.06,0:00:41.34,SV,METTE,0,0,0,,Jag har tänkt på planter. Jag väntar hela\Nlivet och sen...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.34,0:00:42.04,ZH,METTE,0,0,0,,……它就死了。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.34,0:00:41.84,SV,METTE,0,0,0,,...dör.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.08,0:00:45.42,ZH,METTE,0,0,0,,真是太难过了！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.08,0:00:45.42,SV,METTE,0,0,0,,Fyra vad sårligt!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.88,0:00:46.58,ZH,HARALD,0,0,0,,你真这么觉得？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.88,0:00:46.44,SV,HARALD,0,0,0,,Tycker du det?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.86,0:00:56.38,ZH,METTE,0,0,0,,谢谢你来！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.86,0:00:56.38,SV,METTE,0,0,0,,Tack för att du var här!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.96,0:01:03.36,ZH,METTE,0,0,0,,天哪！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.96,0:01:03.36,SV,METTE,0,0,0,,Gud!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.22,0:01:14.02,ZH,METTE,0,0,0,,不要，不要！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.22,0:01:14.02,SV,METTE,0,0,0,,Nej, nej!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.56,0:01:15.40,ZH,METTE,0,0,0,,开门！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.56,0:01:15.40,SV,METTE,0,0,0,,Öppna!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.28,0:01:17.12,ZH,METTE,0,0,0,,好耶！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.28,0:01:17.12,SV,METTE,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.82,0:01:32.72,ZH,METTE,0,0,0,,记住。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.82,0:01:32.72,SV,METTE,0,0,0,,Kom ihåg.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.76,0:01:34.94,ZH,ELSIE,0,0,0,,说话。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.76,0:01:34.94,SV,ELSIE,0,0,0,,Prata.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.26,0:01:43.48,ZH,METTE,0,0,0,,嗨。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.26,0:01:43.48,SV,METTE,0,0,0,,Hej.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.78,0:01:45.16,ZH,METTE,0,0,0,,来。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.78,0:01:45.16,SV,METTE,0,0,0,,Gå.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.66,0:01:48.06,ZH,METTE,0,0,0,,要不要坐起来？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.66,0:01:48.06,SV,METTE,0,0,0,,Ska jag ta och sitta upp?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.80,0:01:50.46,ZH,METTE,0,0,0,,我看看。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.80,0:01:50.46,SV,METTE,0,0,0,,Så ska vi se.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.02,0:01:57.98,ZH,METTE,0,0,0,,我梦见你了。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.02,0:01:57.98,SV,METTE,0,0,0,,Jag drömde om dig.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.00,0:01:59.78,ZH,ELSIE,0,0,0,,是吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.00,0:01:59.78,SV,ELSIE,0,0,0,,Ja, det är det.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.34,0:02:05.36,ZH,METTE,0,0,0,,怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.34,0:02:05.36,SV,METTE,0,0,0,,Vad är det?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.14,0:02:07.04,ZH,METTE,0,0,0,,你为什么那样看我？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.14,0:02:06.94,SV,METTE,0,0,0,,Varför lejnar du åt?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.06,0:02:12.06,ZH,METTE,0,0,0,,看这里。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.06,0:02:12.06,SV,METTE,0,0,0,,Titta här.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.52,0:02:17.08,ZH,METTE,0,0,0,,我不会念的。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.52,0:02:17.08,SV,METTE,0,0,0,,Jag ska inte läsa.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.92,0:02:26.46,ZH,METTE,0,0,0,,我们去洗澡好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.92,0:02:26.46,SV,METTE,0,0,0,,Ska vi duscha?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.56,0:02:27.86,ZH,ELSIE,0,0,0,,不。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.56,0:02:27.86,SV,ELSIE,0,0,0,,Nej.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.98,0:02:29.08,ZH,METTE,0,0,0,,哎！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.98,0:02:29.08,SV,METTE,0,0,0,,Ej!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.08,0:02:30.00,ZH,METTE,0,0,0,,是湖！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.08,0:02:30.00,SV,METTE,0,0,0,,Det är sjön!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.82,0:04:13.82,ZH,METTE,0,0,0,,哈尔德，我觉得你儿子真是个混蛋，他根\N本不会来看你。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.82,0:04:13.82,SV,METTE,0,0,0,,Harald, jag tycker att din son är en stor\Nidiot som inte kommer hitta hälsa på.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.38,0:04:18.24,ZH,METTE,0,0,0,,但如果你愿意，我可以想办法让他过来。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.38,0:04:18.24,SV,METTE,0,0,0,,Men om du vill så kan jag se till att han\Nkommer hit.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.10,0:04:21.18,ZH,HARALD,0,0,0,,他不会来的。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.10,0:04:21.18,SV,HARALD,0,0,0,,Han kommer inte hit.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.14,0:04:25.14,ZH,HARALD,0,0,0,,但等我死后，他就躲不掉了。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.14,0:04:25.14,SV,HARALD,0,0,0,,Men när jag är död då kan han inte komma\Nundan.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.18,0:04:30.38,ZH,HARALD,0,0,0,,那时他就别无选择。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.18,0:04:30.38,SV,HARALD,0,0,0,,Då har han inget val.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.68,0:05:14.30,ZH,METTE,0,0,0,,你要去哪儿？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.68,0:05:14.30,SV,METTE,0,0,0,,Vad ska du?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.42,0:05:18.82,ZH,HARALD,0,0,0,,哪儿也不去。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.42,0:05:18.82,SV,HARALD,0,0,0,,Ingenstans.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.18,0:05:27.98,ZH,METTE,0,0,0,,你要做什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.18,0:05:27.98,SV,METTE,0,0,0,,Vad ska du?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.08,0:05:42.68,ZH,METTE,0,0,0,,你是在盯着一株植物，还是在看夜色？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.08,0:05:42.68,SV,METTE,0,0,0,,Håller du på att stirra på en planta eller\Nnatten?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.26,0:05:44.14,ZH,METTE,0,0,0,,你从来不睡觉吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.26,0:05:44.14,SV,METTE,0,0,0,,Sover du aldrig?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.76,0:05:45.64,ZH,HARALD,0,0,0,,我吃得不多。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.76,0:05:45.64,SV,HARALD,0,0,0,,Jag äter inte mycket.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.10,0:05:48.14,ZH,METTE,0,0,0,,我从来不吃。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.10,0:05:48.14,SV,METTE,0,0,0,,Jag äter aldrig.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.38,0:06:05.48,ZH,METTE,0,0,0,,我没有父母。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.38,0:06:05.48,SV,METTE,0,0,0,,Jag har inga föräldrar.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.96,0:06:06.68,ZH,MARTA,0,0,0,,我不知道。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.96,0:06:06.68,SV,MARTA,0,0,0,,Jag visste inte det.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.54,0:06:08.84,ZH,MARTA,0,0,0,,那你是在森林里被谁发现的？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.54,0:06:08.82,SV,MARTA,0,0,0,,Vem var du som hittade i skogen?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.30,0:06:10.32,ZH,METTE,0,0,0,,我挨了一脚。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.30,0:06:10.32,SV,METTE,0,0,0,,Jag fick ett steg.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.74,0:06:23.24,ZH,METTE,0,0,0,,你得到了一点。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.74,0:06:23.24,SV,METTE,0,0,0,,Du har fått lite.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.00,0:07:00.80,ZH,METTE,0,0,0,,这个数字。现在要听这个数字。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.00,0:07:00.80,SV,METTE,0,0,0,,Det här talet. För att höra talet nu.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.40,0:07:06.94,ZH,METTE,0,0,0,,我不知道你在搞什么。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.40,0:07:06.94,SV,METTE,0,0,0,,Jag vet inte vad du sysslar med.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.84,0:07:41.60,ZH,ELSIE,0,0,0,,你真是个坏女孩。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.84,0:07:41.60,SV,ELSIE,0,0,0,,Du är en dålig flicka.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.60,0:07:44.18,ZH,ELSIE,0,0,0,,你还害羞呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.60,0:07:44.18,SV,ELSIE,0,0,0,,Du både kämmas!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.08,0:07:50.00,ZH,METTE,0,0,0,,我想留住她！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.08,0:07:50.00,SV,METTE,0,0,0,,Jag vill bihålla henne!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.22,0:08:05.42,ZH,METTE,0,0,0,,我想让它再往下一点。感觉不太明显。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.22,0:08:05.42,SV,METTE,0,0,0,,Jag vill att den ska liberera lite ner.\NDet känns inte så mycket.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.40,0:08:10.60,ZH,METTE,0,0,0,,只是电池。对，里面有股臭味，还有别的\N东西。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.40,0:08:10.60,SV,METTE,0,0,0,,Det är bara batteri, ja. Det är stink och\Nnågonting här inne.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.50,0:08:13.86,ZH,ELSIE,0,0,0,,总不会是你吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.50,0:08:13.86,SV,ELSIE,0,0,0,,Det är väl inte du, ensi?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.38,0:08:18.82,ZH,METTE,0,0,0,,听说它们在床上很好用。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.38,0:08:18.82,SV,METTE,0,0,0,,De ska vara bra i sängen.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.62,0:08:20.98,ZH,METTE,0,0,0,,这就是人们需要它们的用途。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.62,0:08:20.98,SV,METTE,0,0,0,,Det är helt man behöver dem till.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.40,0:08:27.78,ZH,ELSIE,0,0,0,,什么东西这么臭？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.40,0:08:27.78,SV,ELSIE,0,0,0,,Vad är det som är stink?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.78,0:08:28.48,ZH,METTE,0,0,0,,过来。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.78,0:08:28.48,SV,METTE,0,0,0,,Kom här.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.00,0:08:39.86,ZH,METTE,0,0,0,,这只是个礼物。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.00,0:08:39.86,SV,METTE,0,0,0,,Det är bara present.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.14,0:08:47.12,ZH,ELSIE,0,0,0,,噢，真见鬼！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.14,0:08:47.12,SV,ELSIE,0,0,0,,Åh fy helvete.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.26,0:08:50.22,ZH,METTE,0,0,0,,那我们可以把它放到枕头底下。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.26,0:08:50.22,SV,METTE,0,0,0,,Då kan vi lägga den under alls kudde.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.64,0:09:34.90,ZH,MARTA,0,0,0,,有多少？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.64,0:09:34.90,SV,MARTA,0,0,0,,Hur mycket på gång?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.66,0:09:37.66,ZH,MARTA,0,0,0,,有什么好玩的事吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.66,0:09:37.66,SV,MARTA,0,0,0,,Hände något roligt?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.06,0:09:42.52,ZH,METTE,0,0,0,,你知道，他已经……
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.06,0:09:42.52,SV,METTE,0,0,0,,Du vet, han har...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.52,0:09:44.58,ZH,MARTA,0,0,0,,我当然去过很多次墓园。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.52,0:09:44.58,SV,MARTA,0,0,0,,Jag gick väldigt på kyrkogården, förstås.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.38,0:09:50.12,ZH,METTE,0,0,0,,你们这些人，到底怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.38,0:09:50.12,SV,METTE,0,0,0,,Du männisar, vad fan är det?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.70,0:09:56.18,ZH,METTE,0,0,0,,可是……
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.70,0:09:56.18,SV,METTE,0,0,0,,Men...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.72,0:09:57.98,ZH,METTE,0,0,0,,管它呢，谁在乎。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.72,0:09:57.98,SV,METTE,0,0,0,,Skit i håll, nån.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.98,0:09:58.22,ZH,MARTA,0,0,0,,现在！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.98,0:09:58.22,SV,MARTA,0,0,0,,Nu!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.64,0:10:31.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,1. 移除固定物。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.64,0:10:31.94,SV,,0,0,0,,1. Ta bort fästningarna.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.98,0:10:38.98,ZH,METTE,0,0,0,,两个月后，它会和右半边大脑一样大。它\N在夜里生长；后半句听不清。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.98,0:10:38.03,SV,METTE,0,0,0,,Om två månader kommer den vara lika stor\Nsom högra hjärnhalvan. Det är på nätterna
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.03,0:10:44.08,SV,METTE,0,0,0,,den växer; resten är oklart.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.00,0:11:29.50,ZH,MARTA,0,0,0,,七十岁以上。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.00,0:11:29.50,SV,MARTA,0,0,0,,70 plus.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.50,0:11:31.76,ZH,MARTA,0,0,0,,想找一位女士。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.50,0:11:31.76,SV,MARTA,0,0,0,,Söker nog en kvinna.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.96,0:11:38.14,ZH,METTE,0,0,0,,听起来没那么糟吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.96,0:11:38.14,SV,METTE,0,0,0,,Det låter väl inte så farligt?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.20,0:11:41.36,ZH,MARTA,0,0,0,,我不喜欢说话。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.20,0:11:41.36,SV,MARTA,0,0,0,,Jag tycker inte om att prata.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.96,0:11:43.90,ZH,METTE,0,0,0,,不，我们不适合写信。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.96,0:11:43.90,SV,METTE,0,0,0,,Nej, vi passar inte bara att skriva.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.70,0:11:46.02,ZH,MARTA,0,0,0,,我想睡觉。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.70,0:11:46.02,SV,MARTA,0,0,0,,Jag vill sofa.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.80,0:11:49.44,ZH,METTE,0,0,0,,对不起。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.80,0:11:49.44,SV,METTE,0,0,0,,Förlåt.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.58,0:11:59.98,ZH,METTE,0,0,0,,欢迎！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.58,0:11:59.98,SV,METTE,0,0,0,,Välkomna!
